			"Message": "docs(Grove): Expand Funding section with Land intro, table headers, and prose\n\nAdd a contextual opening paragraph introducing Land's open-source mission to the Funding & Acknowledgements section, include a table header row for Land/PlayForm/NLnet/NGI0, lowercase the editor.land URL, wrap the LICENSE link onto a single line, and add inviting text to the Changelog section (\"Stay updated with our progress! See\").\n\nThese changes make the downstream section more welcoming and structurally consistent with the rest of the README, and fix the casing inconsistency in the Land logo link.",
