			"Message": "style(Grove): Remove stray &#x2001; separators from badge lines and heading\n\nThe badge lines on lines 53-55 and the \"System Architecture\" heading contained `&#x2001;` (em-quad) separators that were unnecessary — badge elements already have natural spacing via Markdown rendering, and the heading separator was inconsistent with other section headings. Removing these fixes the visual inconsistency introduced in the recent README revamp.\n\nThis is a pure style change with no content impact.",
